[[0,52538,0,4,0,4,"2015-02-19T23:55:17","Humidity","[e]",[],"<p><a href=\"https://preview.voat.co/v/skullgirls\">/v/skullgirls</a></p>\n<p>I've never founded anything or was a moderator. I'm not too used to contributing content to a community. What can I do to catalyze the subverse?</p>\n<p>EDIT: based on the recommendation by <a href=\"https://preview.voat.co/user/Slug\">/u/Slug</a>, I've added a welcome post.</p>","I made a subverse, but I don't know CSS or whatever and I'm new to contributing a lot. What should I do?","","AskVoat"],[1,70024,0,1,0,1,"2015-02-20T00:18:40","nearly-evil","",[],"<p>Nothing comes up on that verse, did you delete it?</p>"],[2,70038,70024,0,0,0,"2015-02-20T00:26:49","Humidity","[e]",[],"<p>I didn&#39;t touch it at all. Lemme go see what the issue is.</p>\n<p>EDIT: it just kinda disappeared. I remade it. I&#39;m gonna find something to post so it doesn&#39;t go kaputt again.</p>\n<p>EDIT2: I can&#39;t think of anything to post. I&#39;m friends with one of the mods of reddit&#39;s subreddit for skullgirls, so I am going to ask if I can use their stickied post as a model to create a first post, which will be accomplishing the same thing (but with different wording).</p>"],[1,70066,0,1,0,1,"2015-02-20T00:43:03","Slug","",[],"<p>For CSS, try <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/CustomizingVoat\">/v/CustomizingVoat</a>, <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/CSS\">/v/CSS</a>, <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/Typogra\">/v/Typogra</a>. </p>\n<p>You can also try <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/ModHelp\">/v/ModHelp</a></p>\n<p>To start it up, start posting the basics. Maybe a &quot;Welcome to Skullgirls!&quot; message where you let everyone know what's going on.</p>\n<p>I don't know much about Skullgirls, so I don't know what you would even post in that sub. Is it a game?</p>"],[2,70153,70066,0,0,0,"2015-02-20T01:29:24","Humidity","",[],"<p>I'll look into those subverses.</p>\n<p>It's a 2D fighting game developed by Lab Zero. It's fun, but the art style makes it &quot;not-for-everyone.&quot;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skullgirls\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skullgirls</a></p>"]]
